	"title"		"Atmos: Human Start Boost"
	"description"		"Configurable human-only sight, movement and starting units for Civilization VI.

Replaces mods like:
- Extra Starting Settler (Human Players Only)
- Sight Enhance
- Move +2 (Human Only)
- Player's first settler grants +N movement/+N Sight

Advanced Setup sliders (defaults):
- Sight +2
- Movement +2
- +1 Settler, +1 Builder, +2 Scouts, +0 Warriors

Human players only. Respects unique unit replacements (e.g. Cree Okihtcitaw instead of Scout).
Disable the old similar mods or bonuses will stack.

RU: Настраиваемые бонусы обзора, хода и стартовых юнитов только для человека."
